  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Big Small Businesses Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Serbia):  .Small Medium Enterprises (SMEs) play a significant role in driving Serbia&apos;s economy, but face challenges in growing further and meeting EU standards. USAID&apos;s Big Small Businesses Activity will: (1) improve productivity and profitability of SMEs through enhanced management and modernization; (2) expand SME exports through improved market alignment and adaptations; and (3) increase SMEs utilization of financing instruments. ..The activity will focus in sectors that present export market opportunity and the potential for inclusive growth in underdeveloped regions of the country. Those sectors are agriculture and food and equipment and machinery, with cross-sectoral programming on digital development, green growth, and human capacity development to increase opportunities for women and youth. The activity will help Serbian SMEs align with the EU, US, and other higher-value markets. In doing so, it will seek to incorporate best practices, models, and technology from developed countries, such as the U.S., including seeking opportunities for collaboration among educational institutions...This activity supports the USG&apos;s priorities to grow economic opportunities and prosperity and champion equity and inclusion. It supports ICS Mission Objective 2.1 &quot;Broad-Based, Inclusive, and Sustainable Economic Growth Accelerated,&quot; and CAATSA Goal 8..</narrative>
  </description>
